Non-brand paid search spend in Q3 2025 was about $2,161,933.

I summed spend on the `FH_Search_NonBrand` campaign in Google Ads. I counted the 13 weeks whose Monday falls in Q3 (2025-07-07 through 2025-09-29) across all 20 regions.

