Non-brand paid search cost per click in Q2 2024 was about $8.97. That is $1,461,211.41 in spend divided by 162,934 clicks.

I used the `FH_Search_NonBrand` campaign in the Google Ads weekly table. I counted weeks whose Monday falls between 2024-04-01 and 2024-06-30.

