YouTube's CPM in 2023 was about $10.19. That is $1,000,000 of spend over 98,095,430 impressions, per 1,000 impressions.

I counted the "FH_YouTube_Prospecting" campaign (campaign type VIDEO) in `ads_google_weekly` as YouTube. Weeks were assigned to a year by their Monday start date.

