Meta reported 67,901 leads on its own platform in 2025. That's the sum of `leads` in `ads_meta_weekly` for weeks starting on a Monday in 2025 (2025-01-06 through 2025-12-22).

The Meta table has no column called "conversions". Its only outcome metric is `leads`, so I treated leads as Meta's reported conversions. If you define a conversion differently, this number won't apply.

