Opportunities created in 2023 total $88,978,140 in pipeline. That sums the `amount` on all 32,838 opportunities in `crm_opportunities` with a 2023 `created_date`. The total is $28,514,490 from Closed Won and $60,463,650 from Closed Lost. There are no open opportunities from that year. Opportunity IDs are unique, so nothing is double-counted.

I counted every stage, since pipeline created normally means all opportunities created, whatever their outcome. I didn't find a definition of pipeline in the data, so that is my assumption.

