I can't answer this from the data. None of the tables define a channel "role", so there's no mapping that says which channels count as performance and which don't.

The channels and their spend are available: search brand and non-brand, YouTube, display, Meta, LinkedIn, CTV, partners and affiliates. Without a role definition, though, I'd have to guess which ones are "performance". That would make any percentage an estimate. If you give me the list of performance-role channels, I can calculate the 2023 share.

